WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Each dot is a flower. Its position shows petal length and width. The colour shows the species we already know. Here you choose a rule; in the next lab the model will learn from examples. Goal: see how data and labels let you set up a classification.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Two fictional flowers show petal measurements and species labels. Your task: tell apart the input data and the labels. Hint: measuring a flower is not the same as knowing its species.

